cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Images to Montage
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Aesthetic Vulpes
    website: https://github.com/didvc/
repository-code: https://github.com/html-js/images-to-montage
url: https://html-js.github.io/images-to-montage/
license: AGPL-3.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-07
abstract: >
  A single-page, zero-dependency browser tool that combines many images into
  one montage, collage or contact sheet. Pictures arrive by drag and drop,
  paste, file or folder pickers, or typed paths and URLs, and are laid out as
  a grid, justified rows, masonry columns, a single row or a single column,
  with gaps, padding, rounded corners, borders and optional captions. The
  result is exported as PNG, JPEG or WebP, or copied to the clipboard, and
  every step runs locally in the browser.
keywords:
  - image-montage
  - photo-collage
  - collage-maker
  - contact-sheet
  - combine-images
  - merge-images
  - image-grid
  - masonry-layout
  - justified-layout
  - screenshot-stitching
